WEBVTT

00:00:00.731 --> 00:00:01.400
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.409 --> 00:00:03.513
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> What’s your address?

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:06.933
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Two hundred and thirteen Station Road.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:09.764
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:10.739 --> 00:00:12.083
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> When’s your birthday?

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:13.692
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> The twentieth of June.

00:00:15.671 --> 00:00:16.444
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:17.419 --> 00:00:19.492
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> So how many people live here?

00:00:19.815 --> 00:00:22.779
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> About a hundred and twenty thousand, I think.

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:25.600
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:26.705 --> 00:00:28.533
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> How much did the house cost?

00:00:28.658 --> 00:00:29.361
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> A lot.

00:00:29.525 --> 00:00:31.612
Seven hundred and ninety-five thousand.

00:00:31.787 --> 00:00:33.677
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Is that in pounds or dollars?

00:00:33.757 --> 00:00:34.511
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Dollars.

00:00:36.681 --> 00:00:37.533
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:38.566 --> 00:00:41.274
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> How much of your salary do you spend on rent?

00:00:41.558 --> 00:00:43.885
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Er, at least a third, I think.

00:00:46.181 --> 00:00:46.977
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:48.195 --> 00:00:51.575
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> What percentage of your day do you spend working or studying?

00:00:51.961 --> 00:00:53.192
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I’m not sure.

00:00:53.265 --> 00:00:56.501
Between sixty and seventy per cent, maybe?